      "Contacts come from SAT on oriented boxes with reference-face clipping (the two deepest corners of the incident body), then a sequential-impulse solver, 12 iterations: push apart along the normal, never pull together (<code>pn = max(0, pn + mn·(−vn + bias))</code>), and friction along the face capped by how hard they press (<code>pt = clamp(pt − mt·vt, ±μ·pn)</code>).",
