      en: "A 24-hour ring of ticks with two handles. The span between them is measured the short way round, so either handle is free to cross midnight; the ticks inside the span darken and the centre reads the duration. Snap to 5, 15 or 30 minutes; tick density and handle reach are live.",
      zh: "一圈 24 小时刻度、两个把手。两者之间的跨度按短的那边算，所以任一把手都能跨过午夜；跨度内的刻度变深，中间显示时长。可吸附 5 / 15 / 30 分钟；刻度密度和把手半径可调。",
